{"version":1,"content":"<p>方力申破健力士世界紀錄後，昨晚（21日）接連出席音樂會，同場還有胡定欣與林盛斌（Bob）。</p><p>定欣除了獨唱外，更與相識30年的小方合唱經典金曲《好心好報》。</p><p>對於小方打破紀錄，定欣直言對這位老友打從心底敬畏，透露坐車赴澳期間一直透過直播關注其進度</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:23:37.637200+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:47:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T05:17:01.821038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:17:01.821038+00:00","content_hash":"35fbdabbd6345024d6c1c1a9f75cb4f7501fcdd4c841ff7d8d70e99d00e3ef1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}